@baseUrl = http://localhost:5197

### 1. Buat Short URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "longUrl": "https://github.com/LenixRiz"
}

### 2. Coba Redirect (Ganti XXXXX dengan shortCode hasil respon atas)
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/80ArvPiJZ6

### 3. Cek Statistik Tautan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/80K8CoSP8Q